%% State 02c — Sprint-close assigner/environment review workflow
%% Evidence status: Implemented; external AI advisory is Partial.
%% Updated: 2026-07-28.
%% Canonical UI: two Project boards share this lifecycle and render all eight lanes.

stateDiagram-v2
direction TB
    [*] --> awaiting_review : sprint review opens
    awaiting_review --> awaiting_response : reviewer submits rating/comment
    awaiting_response --> done : responder accepts
    awaiting_response --> disputed : responder challenges
    disputed --> done : responder accepts outcome
    disputed --> reported : participant reports
    reported --> ai_reviewing : System Admin starts AI advisory
    ai_reviewing --> reported : signed callback stores advice
    reported --> resolved : System Admin resolves
    ai_reviewing --> resolved : System Admin resolves
    done --> [*]
    resolved --> [*]

    state "in_review" as in_review

    note right of awaiting_review
        target_type = assigner or environment.
        Current single-review submit goes directly
        to awaiting_response.
    end note

    note right of in_review
        Visible compatibility/reserved lane.
        No active single-review command writes it.
    end note
